## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a minimal cross‑platform native bridge with lifecycle awareness and cleanup.

## Key Concepts

- RN native module basics, EventEmitter binding
- iOS Locale APIs and Android Locale APIs
- Threading, callback lifecycles, memory management

## Code Example

```javascript
import { NativeModules, NativeEventEmitter } from 'react-native';
const { LocaleBridge } = NativeModules;
const emitter = new NativeEventEmitter(LocaleBridge);
let locale = LocaleBridge.getLocale();
emitter.addListener('localeChanged', (l) => { locale = l; /* refresh UI */ });
LocaleBridge.stopListener();
```

